---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | TAKA Scientific"
  description="How TAKA Scientific collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you use taka.ae or contact us."
  hasHero={true}
  headerSolid={true}
>
  <Legal
    eyebrow="Privacy Policy"
    title="Your data, handled with care."
    intro="This Privacy Policy explains how TAKA Scientific (“we”, “our”) collects, uses, and protects personal information when you visit taka.ae or contact us."
    updated="6 August 2026"
  >
    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        TAKA Scientific is an Abu Dhabi-based supplier of scientific equipment,
        laboratory furniture, testing apparatus, and laboratory consumables,
        operating across the United Arab Emirates. We are the data controller
        for personal information collected through this website.
      </p>
      <p class="legal-p">
        You can reach us at
        <a class="legal-a" href="mailto:info@taka.ae">info@taka.ae</a> or
        <a class="legal-a" href="tel:+97125554047">+971 2 555 4047</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">2. Information we collect</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        We collect information you provide directly, and information collected
        automatically when you use the website:
      </p>
      <ul class="legal-ul">
        <li class="legal-li">Contact details you submit through our contact form — name, email address, phone number, company, and message.</li>
        <li class="legal-li">Correspondence, including emails and WhatsApp messages you send to us.</li>
        <li class="legal-li">Usage information such as pages visited and device data, where collected through analytics.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">3. How we use your information</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">We use personal information to:</p>
      <ul class="legal-ul">
        <li class="legal-li">Respond to enquiries and prepare quotations.</li>
        <li class="legal-li">Process orders, arrange delivery and installation, and provide after-sales support.</li>
        <li class="legal-li">Improve our website, products, and services.</li>
        <li class="legal-li">Comply with legal and regulatory obligations.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">4. Legal basis and applicable law</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        We process personal information on the lawful bases of consent,
        performance of a contract, and legitimate interests. Processing is
        carried out in accordance with the UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of
        2021 on the Protection of Personal Data and other applicable
        regulations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">5. Sharing your information</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        We do not sell or rent your personal information. We share information
        only where necessary to provide our services — for example with
        logistics partners, installation teams, or website hosting providers —
        and where required or permitted by law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">6. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        This website may use cookies and similar technologies to remember your
        preferences and understand how the site is used. You can control or
        disable cookies through your browser settings; disabling cookies may
        affect certain features of the site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">7. Data retention</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        We keep personal information only for as long as needed to fulfil the
        purposes described in this policy, to provide after-sales support, or
        as required by law. Records relating to orders and warranties are
        retained for the period required by applicable regulations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">8. Data security</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        We apply reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect
        personal information against loss, misuse, and unauthorised access. No
        method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot
        guarantee absolute security.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">9. Your rights</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Subject to applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or
        deletion of your personal information, and you may object to or
        restrict certain processing. To exercise these rights, contact us at
        <a class="legal-a" href="mailto:info@taka.ae">info@taka.ae</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">10. Third-party websites</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Our website may link to external websites, such as WhatsApp or
        LinkedIn. These sites operate under their own privacy policies, and we
        are not responsible for their content or practices.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">11. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be
        posted on this page with an updated revision date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">12. Contact us</h2>
      <div class="legal-contact">
        <p class="legal-p"><strong>TAKA Scientific</strong></p>
        <p class="legal-p">Email: <a class="legal-a" href="mailto:info@taka.ae">info@taka.ae</a></p>
        <p class="legal-p">Phone: <a class="legal-a" href="tel:+97125554047">+971 2 555 4047</a></p>
        <p class="legal-p">Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Legal>
</Layout>
